      "bun run typecheck",
      "node .agentplane/policy/check-routing.mjs",
      "- In scope: Add a natural-language task create entrypoint with deterministic defaults, explainable workflow route preview, concise human status, and dry-run execution preview while retaining existing advanced task new and agent-json contracts.\n- Out of scope: unrelated refactors not required for \"Add user-first task intake and execution preview\".",
